{"id":"ce85b34cfad5ccf3","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-center.md","title":"Center of Algebra","display":"df-center — Center of Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-center","aliases":["58-df-center","Center of Algebra"],"display":"df-center — Center of Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-ring]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-center"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-center</span><span>Center of Algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-center — Center of Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,Z,a,z,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A\">\\(A,Z,a,z,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A\\)</span> (ring parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\)</span> (ring predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Center}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Center}_S\\)</span> (center predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}center} \\vdash \\mathrm{Center}_S(Z,A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\land Z=\\{z\\in A\\mid\\forall a\\in A\\;(z\\cdot a=a\\cdot z)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}center} \\vdash \\mathrm{Center}_S(Z,A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\land Z=\\{z\\in A\\mid\\forall a\\in A\\;(z\\cdot a=a\\cdot z)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The center is determined extensionally; its subring property follows from the ring axioms and is not an additional defining conjunct.</li>\n<li>Group center: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(G) = \\{z : gz = zg, \\forall g \\in G\\}\">\\(Z(G) = \\{z : gz = zg, \\forall g \\in G\\}\\)</span>; normal subgroup</li>\n<li>Central simple algebra: center is base field; classified by Brauer group</li>\n<li>Central series: lower/upper central series measure nilpotency/solvability</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Herstein, Noncommutative Rings</li>\n<li>Lam, First Course in Noncommutative Rings</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S$ (ring predicate, see [[58-df-ring]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,Z,a,z,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Center}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}center} \\vdash \\mathrm{Center}_S(Z,A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\land Z=\\{z\\in A\\mid\\forall a\\in A\\;(z\\cdot a=a\\cdot z)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"Z(G) = \\{z : gz = zg, \\forall g \\in G\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1099,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-center.md|58-df-center]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["1c30d21ea7b443f6"]}